t="epo"><addressbook><name>IDA KATSUHISA</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>KITAURA HIROMI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>KURUMA KENICHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>NAKANISHI YOSHIHIKO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>SUGANO YOSHIHITO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>HAYASHI, HIROYUKI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>HIGUCHI, NOBUO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>HIRABAYASHI, MICHIO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>IDA, KATSUHISA</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KITAURA, HIROMI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KURUMA, KENICHI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>NAKANISHI, YOSHIHIKO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SUGANO, YOSHIHITO</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A robot (210A, 210B) is fixed to rectangular base blocks (20A, 20B) and has mechanical hands (211A, 211B).  A plurality of robot tools mountable on the front ends of the mechanical hands (211A, 211B) for gripping parts and a plurality of trays (6) having placed thereon assembling tools including assembling jigs used for assembling parts are carried into the movable range (RA, RB) of the robot and the assembling tools are set at predetermined locations in this movable range (RA, RB).  And the assembling tools thus set are used to perform the parts assembling operation.  This ensures that even if a change of assembly type has been made, change of the assembling tools can be effected without resorting to manpower.  As a result, a multi-product, small-lot production can be efficiently effected.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>Un robot (210A, 210B), fixé à des blocs supports rectangulaires (20A, 20B), comprend des mains mécaniques (211A, 211B), une pluralité d'outils robotisés aptes à être montés sur les extrémités avant de ces mains mécaniques (211A, 211B) afin de saisir des pièces, et une pluralité de plateaux (6) sur lesquels sont placés des outils d'assemblage, notamment des gabarits utilisés pour assembler plusieurs pièces, reposant sur le disque mobile (RA, RB) du robot. Les outils d'assemblage sont par ailleurs disposés à des emplacements prédéterminés sur ce disque mobile (RA, RB), et donc employés pour procéder à l'assemblage desdites pièces. On peut ainsi opérer un changement d'outils d'assemblage, dans le cas d'une modification du type d'assemblage, sans qu'un ouvrier n'ait à intervenir, et donc produire efficacement différents biens en petite quantité.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>